Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari itu, pasar terguncang hebat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pusat guncangannya adalah Bank of Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biasa disingkat Nichigin atau BoJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pelonggaran moneter adalah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sederhananya, kebijakan negara\Nuntuk menambah jumlah uang beredar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}demi mendorong pelemahan Yen\Ndan kenaikan harga barang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terlepas dari baik buruknya kebijakan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.43,0:00:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}pengumuman yang di luar dugaan\Npara pelaku pasar tersebut
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}turut mengguncang para investor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.23,0:00:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan pilar api raksasa pun muncul\Ndi pasar USD/JPY.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.11,0:00:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}112 yen per dolar?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.29,0:00:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini pasti akan dicatat dalam sejarah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:01:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pesta pora seperti ini\Nenggak akan bertahan lama.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biasanya aku ingin segera ambil untung,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kali ini berbeda!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Justru ikut terjun adalah pilihan tepat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.05,0:01:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Posisi beli penuh, tembak 120 lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.47,0:01:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Targetku adalah 20 juta yen\Nsetelah dipotong pajak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.33,0:01:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang masih jauh, tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.59,0:01:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kalau ini berkembang menjadi tren besar...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.92,0:01:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau aku melibas semuanya\Ndengan posisi beli ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bisa langsung mendekatinya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh, aku enggak bisa tahan tawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kiriman makanan dari rumah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}datang juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.02,0:03:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini membantu banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hore! Sekilas isinya banyak kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk Mebuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.59,0:03:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menabung untuk uang kuliah\Npasti berat, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:03:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu sudah mengirimkan makanan,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.97,0:04:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi bersemangatlah dan berjuang!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari Ibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Mochiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.36,0:04:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Gawat"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.99,0:04:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu dalam arti yang baik, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cut loss paksa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.14,0:04:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat, gawat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.67,0:04:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus merebutnya kembali,\Nkalau enggak aku tamat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.98,0:04:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus deposit ke akun Forex!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.28,0:04:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak, enggak bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.43,0:04:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua uang sudah kudepositkan,\Nsampai habis tanpa sisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.31,0:05:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh iya, uang di dompet...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kosong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.53,0:05:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak ada sama sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa bisa enggak ada?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.00,0:05:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kupon seperti ini\Nenggak ada gunanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seingatku, kartu kredit juga...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa dipakai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.66,0:05:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Metode deposit ajaib!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.55,0:05:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jenius, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.21,0:05:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bikin tiga kartu demi poinnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.06,0:05:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena belakangan ini aku hidup hemat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.65,0:05:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}semua limitnya pasti masih penuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.81,0:05:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Total limit belanja 300 ribu yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.57,0:05:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jadi masih bisa bertarung!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.98,0:05:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagian, kartu kredit bisa dicicil!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, keuanganku lagi seret...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tenang, ada cicilan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cukup bayar 10 ribu yen per bulan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.41,0:05:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengatur keuangan pun jadi mudah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seingatku ada fitur cicilan bunga tetap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.13,0:05:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.15,0:05:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ini benar-benar boleh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kayaknya ini terlalu bahaya, deh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.59,0:06:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus cepat jual sebelum telat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kartu kredit! Segel dibuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lanjut serangan cepat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.75,0:06:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tembak posisi jual 20 lot USD/JPY!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagus! Sempat sebelum harganya jatuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau turun 10 yen dari sini,\Nuntungnya 2 juta yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa balik modal dalam sekali serang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cut loss paksa di 114 yen,\Nnaik 1,5 yen dari sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak mungkin\Nnaik lebih tinggi lagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa masih naik terus?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat, pasar mau membunuhku lagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.76,0:06:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Mochiko, aku harus bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat transaksi AUD/JPY,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.74,0:07:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurumi berutang demi menang taruhan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu ya, dia sudah pernah beritahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asal punya modal,\Naku enggak akan kena cut loss paksa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.86,0:07:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cukup terus berutang sampai menang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.65,0:07:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski enggak punya uang di tangan,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku enggak boleh menyerah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu saat peluang datang,\Nlempar uang dan raih kemenangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.61,0:07:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Inilah jurus curang investasi\Nyang enggak terkalahkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mebuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yasuko?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bodoh sekali aku! Mana mungkin\Naku bisa pinjam uang sebanyak itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.77,0:07:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan kalau kalah, tamat riwayatku!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.57,0:07:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah, kamu akhirnya sadar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.75,0:07:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudahlah, berhenti saja, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yasuko...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, aku tetap enggak bisa berhenti.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah habiskan uang\Nyang enggak boleh hilang,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bahkan sampai pakai kartu kredit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak bisa mundur lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.12,0:08:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pokoknya...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku harus...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.57,0:08:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}menang bagaimanapun caranya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.17,0:08:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setiap langkah naik membakar nyawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.14,0:08:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sebuah tangga yang membara.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu mungkin tangga spiral neraka
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.69,0:08:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang terbentang tanpa ujung.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.19,0:08:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.91,0:08:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mebuki tidak punya pilihan\Nselain terus mendaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asalkan mampu mendaki sampai akhir,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.01,0:08:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}semua kerugiannya selama ini\Nbisa kembali.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena penurunan harga\Nyang diharapkan bisa saja terjadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.70,0:08:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau menang, kubayar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:08:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau menang, kubayar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau menang, kubayar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.09,0:09:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak apa-apa, jangan takut.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.73,0:09:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini jalan yang juga pernah\Nditempuh Kak Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.02,0:09:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini utang di jalan yang benar,\Ndemi menang di Forex!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.90,0:09:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagi kalian yang bingung\Nmencari kerja!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.31,0:09:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang, paket lengkap melamar kerja\Ndi toko kami
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- diskon 20% untuk semua kombinasi!\N- Duh, malas banget cari kerja.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.11,0:09:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku masih ingin jadi mahasiswi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.67,0:09:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu enggak perlu bekerja kan, Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu bisa hidup dari Forex, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hmm, jadi trader penuh waktu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.18,0:09:36.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh juga, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Padahal aku cuma bercanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bohong, kok!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.44,0:09:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku berencana berhenti Forex\Nsetelah menang besar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.94,0:09:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, kamu sudah\Ndapat kabar dari Mebuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.11,0:09:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Barusan kulihat ada pesan dari dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.07,0:09:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katanya hari ini ada urusan,\Njadi enggak bisa ikut.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.86,0:09:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini aku enggak bisa ikut.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.16,0:10:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Uangku habis, jadi aku pinjam uang\Ndari pinjaman mahasiswa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku lanjut bertarung dengan posisi\Njual USD/JPY.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mari bertahan melewati kenaikan ini\Nbersama-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.54,0:10:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan hanya mentalnya belum patah,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia bahkan nekat meminjam uang...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, lanjut tahan posisi\Nbeli USD/JPY saja, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak bisa! Ukurannya enggak pas!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.97,0:10:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagian, kenapa aku juga harus\Ncoba pakaian ini?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.09,0:10:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kan enggak ngelamar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yasuko imut, deh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.83,0:10:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pasti langsung diterima kerja!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu cuma bersenang-senang, kan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.91,0:10:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Coba bilang, "Mau makan sushi?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.26,0:10:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Apa maksudnya itu?!\N- Cebol.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi emang iya,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.35,0:10:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku juga enggak bisa terus\Njadi pekerja paruh waktu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.40,0:10:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Waktu kita kumpul itu,\Nkamu bilang mau menggambar manga, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejak itu aku sudah upload\Nbeberapa karya, tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.90,0:11:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak ada satu pun yang laku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.90,0:11:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah, satu pun enggak ada?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.38,0:11:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, yang responsnya\Npaling banyak...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}malah dailytwt-ku yang enggak penting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ngapain pada nge-like, sih?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya kamu sudah tahu\Ntren dan strateginya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.74,0:11:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tetap aja aku enggak tahu\Napa yang orang suka.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kapalan di jariku ini\Nmeraung penuh kesedihan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.64,0:11:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jujur, aku meremehkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, aku kehabisan ide.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.94,0:11:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sudah coba ide ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.82,0:11:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Manga tentang kelinci yang main Forex.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.76,0:11:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelinci... bermain Forex?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:12:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua dana kegiatanku ludes di Forex.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.70,0:12:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini makan satu umeboshi lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya ingin mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mana mungkin aku gambar\Ncerita semenyedihkan itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.71,0:12:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu iblis, ya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Sudah pasti kalah, ya.\N- Enggak bisa! Enggak bisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.67,0:12:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begini, kucari aja\Nyang responsnya agak bagus...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Loh? Yang ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan viral?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.34,0:12:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah! Keren dong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.71,0:12:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Coba lihat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.25,0:12:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini manga yang kugambar asal jadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, lucu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku suka yang ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serius?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau aku rilis buku atau suvenir\Ndengan karakter itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}apa kira-kira... bakal laku?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.05,0:12:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Viral belum tentu pasti laku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menurutku ini pasti laku, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.98,0:12:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu juga sering beli barang\Nkayak gini kan, Mochiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Coba lihat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Lihat yang benar, dong!\N- Aku senang karyaku disukai, tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.17,0:12:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Aku sudah paham garis besarnya.\N- rasanya agak campur aduk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya aku sama sekali enggak yakin\Ndengan karya itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:12:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.81,0:13:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku pernah sukses saat trading\Ndengan penuh percaya diri?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak boleh percaya\Npada keyakinanku sendiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang harus kupercaya adalah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"kenyataan" bahwa manga ini\Nmendapat respons!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku putuskan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seluruh sisa saldo akun Forex-ku
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}akan kutanam ke manga konyol ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:22.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalaupun enggak laku dan gagal total,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}masih lebih baik daripada mati di Forex!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.06,0:13:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudnya kamu berhenti main Forex?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.23,0:13:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.37,0:13:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, hebat sekali kamu bisa\Nmengambil keputusan itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal pasar sedang sangat panas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah? Memangnya ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu enggak tahu, Yasuko?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.81,0:13:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}BOJ menambah pelonggaran moneter,\Npelemahan yen makin cepat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}USD/JPY sekarang sudah 113 yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mebuki... aman enggak, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.81,0:13:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pasti untung besar kan, Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.94,0:13:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berapa keuntungan berjalanmu sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.22,0:13:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rahasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.44,0:14:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ih, bikin kesal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, di Forex luar negeri, kalau kalah\Nenggak akan jadi utang, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.75,0:14:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Transaksinya enggak akan\Nmembuat kamu berutang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya ada sistem perlindungannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kalau berutang atas kemauan sendiri,\Nbisa saja terjadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.21,0:14:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}De-Dengar aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.09,0:14:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mebuki kayaknya sudah lama\Npasang posisi jual USD/JPY
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan kayaknya uangnya sudah habis semua.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.43,0:14:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah agak berfirasat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.49,0:14:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Modal awal 200 ribu yen\Nyang sempat untung di tengah jalan
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}habis semua akibat\Npelonggaran moneter kali ini, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, aku rasa memang begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurasa bukan cuma segitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagus kalau dia berhenti setelah ini
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.37,0:14:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan menganggapnya pelajaran mahal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi melihat sikapnya belakangan ini....
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.03,0:15:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}perasaanku enggak enak,\Ntakut dia melakukan hal nekat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei. Apa kita enggak bisa apa-apa\Nbuat bantu dia?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.85,0:15:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak ada.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita semua menanggung\Nrisiko masing-masing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau itu sudah keputusan Mebuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}rugi sebesar apa pun,\Nkita enggak bisa tolong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}MAAF AKU SUDAH MEREPOTKAN KALIAN m(_ _)m
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, itu bukan urusanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.35,0:15:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Te-Temanmu sedang terpuruk, loh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.69,0:15:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu terlalu dingin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.87,0:15:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan tetap beri perhatian ke dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.45,0:15:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.13,0:15:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ibuku meninggal bunuh diri\Nakibat bermain Forex.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku terlanjur meminjam 300 ribu yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asal bayar bunganya tiap bulan,\Naku enggak akan kena denda.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata lebih longgar dari dugaanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan ini aku bisa bertahan\Nuntuk sementara!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.09,0:16:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke-Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak masuk akal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.06,0:16:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa-apaan ini?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar-benar curang!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baru dua hari sejak aku deposit, loh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.36,0:16:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Uang 600 ribu yen hasil\Nmemaksakan batas kemampuanku...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.24,0:17:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah membulatkan tekad, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.37,0:17:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sama sekali enggak boleh kalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bertahan terus sampai harga jatuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma itu satu-satunya jalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.27,0:17:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat, pesannya terlanjur kubaca.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Deposit ratusan ribu yen pun\Nsudah enggak mempan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.29,0:17:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya aku enggak ingin\Nmengandalkannya, tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Halo. Lama enggak ngobrol, ya.\NAda apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurumi, maaf mengganggu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.89,0:18:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku boleh pinjam uang?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.54,0:18:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mendadak banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.31,0:18:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi bokek? Kamu butuh berapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.83,0:18:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau pinjam sekitar 1 juta yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.78,0:18:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jumlah segitu enggak main-main, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Uang sebanyak itu mau kamu pakai apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.28,0:18:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kupakai untuk menang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.38,0:18:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk Forex, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengar, Mebuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.99,0:18:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebaiknya berhenti.\NKamu pasti akan menyesal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.02,0:18:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akui saja kekalahanmu
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.97,0:18:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan mundurlah dari pasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.62,0:18:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kamu berada di posisiku,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.80,0:18:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}apa kamu bisa berhenti sekarang?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.27,0:18:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Kurumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah enggak boleh kalah lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.63,0:18:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.93,0:18:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan 1 juta yen,\Naku masih bisa bertarung!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.82,0:18:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja aku enggak minta cuma-cuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.10,0:19:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kukembalikan 1 juta ditambah 100 ribu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.79,0:19:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menguntungkan sekali, kan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.52,0:19:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pasti enggak akan merugikanmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon! Kumohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.70,0:19:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.86,0:19:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong... aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.89,0:19:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak bisa.\NEnggak bisa kupinjami.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.29,0:19:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku... sebegitunya enggak dipercaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.51,0:19:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan soal itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.15,0:19:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau kamu kalah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.95,0:19:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus kalah dan kalah lagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.42,0:19:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal ada orang yang sampai\Nmeninggal karena itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.67,0:19:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ucapanmu sama sekali\Nenggak meyakinkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.78,0:19:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu bilang aku akan menyesal,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi apa benar begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.06,0:19:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal kamu sendiri berutang\Nlalu untung besar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.09,0:20:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya kamu bersyukur\Nsudah bertaruh waktu itu, kan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.21,0:20:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudahlah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.74,0:20:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf sudah memaksa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.53,0:20:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar si bodoh itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.66,0:20:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei! Keluar kamu, Mebuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tahu kamu di dalam, Mebuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.54,0:20:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia enggak ada?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.29,0:20:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon, angkat teleponnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.47,0:20:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mebuki, di mana kamu sekarang?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.74,0:20:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.42,0:20:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, kamu dengar?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.35,0:20:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katanya ibu Kurumi bunuh diri\Nkarena kalah main Forex.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.32,0:20:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu benar?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.49,0:21:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kalau memang benar,\Nitu agak enggak wajar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.24,0:21:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keluarganya meninggal karena itu,\Ntapi kenapa dia malah ikut main Forex?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.39,0:21:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu enggak ada hubungannya denganku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.98,0:21:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf aku mengganggu mendadak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak apa-apa. Ayo masuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.65,0:21:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi? Apa hal penting\Nyang mau kamu bicarakan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Permintaan ini memang berat,\Ntapi aku mohon...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mohon... pinjami aku uang.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.66,0:21:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.55,0:21:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.03,0:21:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.40,0:21:49.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.96,0:23:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Kurumi,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.39,0:23:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}apa itu "bora" di Forex? Sejenis ikan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.85,0:23:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bora itu maksudnya volatilitas,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.51,0:23:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- yaitu tingkat perubahan harga.\N- Ada kupu-kupu...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.51,0:23:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, kamu dengar, enggak?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.00,0:23:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau enggak mau belajar berbagai hal,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.11,0:23:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu bisa dikerjai orang jahat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ILUSTRASI: maruyono_kamome
